    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present to the market this charming four-bedroom hipped-roof residence set on C25.17 acres situated at Briarfield, Lisacul, Castlerea in a peaceful countryside setting close to Lisacul Village & all its amenities, while remaining conveniently accessible to the larger towns of Ballaghaderreen, Castlerea and Ballyhaunis. Ireland West Airport is a 15 minute drive from the property.\n\nOffering a rare combination of a traditional country residence, extensive grounds and a peaceful rural setting, this property presents an exciting opportunity for those seeking a renovation project.\n\nThe residence is in need of extensive renovation and modernisation throughout, making it particularly suited to purchasers with vision who wish to restore and transform a traditional country home to their own requirements.\n\nThis property comprises of, Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen, Four Bedrooms & Bathroom. \n\nThe property is complemented by traditional stone outbuildings, adding considerable character and providing useful storage, workshop or ancillary-use potential, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\n\nThe residence stands on a total of C17.03 acres of agricultural lands in three lots together with C8.15 acres of turbury bog.\n\nThe combination of residence, outbuildings and extensive acreage is increasingly difficult to find and will appeal to purchasers looking for space, privacy and a rural holding.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended for those seeking a substantial rural renovation project with significant land in a peaceful and accessible part of County Roscommon.\n \n"
      },
